      "anchor": "markdown-extensions",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Markdown Extensions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c81aa5be7899",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "VitePress comes with built in Markdown Extensions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2697e537cf39",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "anchor": "custom-containers",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Custom Containers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a4d54956ab30",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Custom containers can be defined by their types, titles, and contents."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "30a888aad0af",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "anchor": "default-title",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Default Title"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bbf850e8337c",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Input",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "8834e9c87807",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "md",
      "text": "::: info\nThis is an info box.\n:::\n\n::: tip\nThis is a tip.\n:::\n\n::: warning\nThis is a warning.\n:::\n\n::: danger\nThis is a dangerous warning.\n:::\n\n::: details\nThis is a details block.\n:::"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c32e7c43fea",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Output",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "7f652f236757",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "info",
      "title": "INFO",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "ed2b8cff2458",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "This is an info box."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0b363fbebe64",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "tip",
      "title": "TIP",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "e86e30320842",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "This is a tip."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9f6528403424",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "warning",
      "title": "WARNING",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "a8627e6d71d5",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "This is a warning."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a68686c9e2c2",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "danger",
      "title": "DANGER",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "12695d9d6a31",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "This is a dangerous warning."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b3bedb7400c9",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "note",
      "title": "Details",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b3cc758d7fe0",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "This is a details block."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d2bdbd143311",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "anchor": "custom-title",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Custom Title"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a6671e639195",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You may set custom title by appending the text right after the \"type\" of the container."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "add1df29eec8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Input",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "7cd9554ee200",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "md",
      "text": "::: danger STOP\nDanger zone, do not proceed\n:::\n\n::: details Click me to toggle the code\n```js\nconsole.log('Hello, VitePress!')\n```\n:::"
    },
    {
      "id": "18a5e53cb03d",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Output",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "506927ed8418",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "danger",
      "title": "STOP",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "82a43f202fe2",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Danger zone, do not proceed"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "749355f12ed5",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "note",
      "title": "Click me to toggle the code",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "0a9ae58a7629",
          "kind": "code",
          "lang": "js",
          "text": "console.log('Hello, VitePress!')"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "37b258cdd292",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Also, you may set custom titles globally by adding the following content in site config, helpful if not writing in English:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c3ece72bf99f",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "ts",
      "text": "// config.ts\nexport default defineConfig({\n  // ...\n  markdown: {\n    container: {\n      tipLabel: '提示',\n      warningLabel: '警告',\n      dangerLabel: '危险',\n      infoLabel: '信息',\n      detailsLabel: '详细信息'\n    }\n  }\n  // ...\n})"
    },
    {
      "id": "1df448567d78",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "On multilingual sites, these labels can also be overridden per locale - see "
        },
        {
          "text": "Per-locale Markdown Strings",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://vitepress.dev/guide/i18n#per-locale-markdown-strings",
            "kind": "same_domain"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b3350c2da8",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "anchor": "registering-new-containers",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Registering New Containers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c5d3f13dd62d",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Beyond the built-in types, you can register additional containers by mapping their names to their default titles:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "07a00ec8b178",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "ts",
      "text": "// config.ts\nexport default defineConfig({\n  // ...\n  markdown: {\n    container: {\n      customContainers: {\n        success: 'SUCCESS'\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  // ...\n})"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c9e32325559",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Registered names work like the built-in ones - including custom titles, attributes, and the "
        },
        {
          "text": "GitHub-style alert syntax",
          "link": {
            "href": "#github-flavored-alerts",
            "kind": "anchor"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ":"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5d3ec00d54da",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "md",
      "text": "::: success\nYou have completed the walkthrough!\n:::\n\n> [!SUCCESS] Custom title\n> This renders the same way."
    },
    {
      "id": "46f85a963311",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "New containers ship without any styling, so add some in your theme using the container name as the class. For this example, the default theme's palette already provides fitting colors:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9912629d0f54",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "css",
      "text": "/* .vitepress/theme/custom.css */\n.custom-block.success {\n  border-color: transparent;\n  color: var(--vp-c-text-1);\n  background-color: var(--vp-c-success-soft);\n}"
    },
    {
      "id": "449bda84a24c",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "anchor": "nesting",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Nesting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "425deb69c4a6",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "text": ":::",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " markers follow the same rules as fenced code blocks ("
        },
        {
          "text": "```",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "): a fence is only closed by a matching fence that is "
        },
        {
          "text": "at least as long",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " as the one that opened it. To nest containers (or to mix them with "
        },
        {
          "text": "code groups",
          "link": {
            "href": "#code-groups",
            "kind": "anchor"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ") make the outer fence longer than the ones inside it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "32b47c15f438",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Input",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "63fa3866a4d2",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "md",
      "text": ":::: info Outer container\nThis box contains another container.\n\n::: details Inner container\n```js\nconsole.log('Hello, VitePress!')\n```\n:::\n::::"
    },
    {
      "id": "a8dd16876ac1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Output",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2fde118c2cbb",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "info",
      "title": "Outer container",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b23c0306a536",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "This box contains another container."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "05c3cec876c4",
          "kind": "callout",
          "variant": "note",
          "title": "Inner container",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "b1ef4baa0f3d",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "js",
              "text": "console.log('Hello, VitePress!')"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "71d9e7c1649b",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "anchor": "additional-attributes",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Additional Attributes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a5a1801aab98",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You can add additional attributes to the custom containers. We use "
        },
        {
          "text": "@mdit/plugin-attrs",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://mdit-plugins.github.io/attrs.html",
            "kind": "external"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for this feature, and it is supported on almost all markdown elements. For example, you can set the "
        },
        {
          "text": "open",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " attribute to make the details block open by default:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1128957519f8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Input",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4cd2012a8331",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "md",
      "text": "::: details Click me to toggle the code {open}\n```js\nconsole.log('Hello, VitePress!')\n```\n:::"
    },
    {
      "id": "d85604a4f9c0",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Output",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "754e3e20941b",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "note",
      "title": "Click me to toggle the code",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "c2885112bbda",
          "kind": "code",
          "lang": "js",
          "text": "console.log('Hello, VitePress!')"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "36cf234b9e3f",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The special "
        },
        {
          "text": "no-title",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " attribute renders a container without a title element (it has no effect on "
        },
        {
          "text": "details",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", which always needs its summary):"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1128957519f8-2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Input",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "76e60dfdbdf9",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "md",
      "text": "::: tip {no-title}\nJust want to try it out? Skip to the [Quickstart](./getting-started).\n:::"
    },
    {
      "id": "d85604a4f9c0-2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Output",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1185f7e511d0",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "tip",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "cf7a4ec1c645",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Just want to try it out? Skip to the "
            },
            {
              "text": "Quickstart",
              "link": {
                "href": "https://vitepress.dev/guide/getting-started",
                "kind": "same_domain"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1f25b9bd3138",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "anchor": "raw",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "raw",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ff7469effdd1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "This is a special container that can be used to prevent style and router conflicts with VitePress. This is especially useful when you're documenting component libraries."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cc60201d38a1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Syntax",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3579bc7f0f63",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "md",
      "text": "::: raw\nWraps in a `<div class=\"vp-raw\">`\n:::"
    },
    {
      "id": "73d76f9d3c35",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "vp-raw",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " class can be directly used on elements too. Style isolation is currently opt-in:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bb89d660a02c",
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "c07cc53184e3",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Install "
                },
                {
                  "text": "postcss",
                  "marks": [
                    "code"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " with your preferred package manager:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "1172649dc900",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "sh",
              "text": "npm add -D postcss"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "b80c0b67384d",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Create a file named "
                },
                {
                  "text": "docs/postcss.config.mjs",
                  "marks": [
                    "code"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " and add this to it:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "a5c17fde6c9f",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "js",
              "text": "import { postcssIsolateStyles } from 'vitepress'\n\nexport default {\n  plugins: [postcssIsolateStyles()]\n}"
            },
            {
              "id": "77c23e87a037",
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "You can pass its options like this:"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "79035a27e1cc",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "js",
              "text": "postcssIsolateStyles({\n  includeFiles: [/custom\\.css/] // defaults to [/vp-doc\\.css/, /base\\.css/]\n})"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f7f984b17f96",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "anchor": "github-flavored-alerts",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "GitHub-flavored Alerts"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5c3519d4dcf0",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "VitePress also supports "
        },
        {
          "text": "GitHub-flavored alerts",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/writing-on-github/getting-started-with-writing-and-formatting-on-github/basic-writing-and-formatting-syntax#alerts",
            "kind": "external"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to render as callouts. They will be rendered the same as the "
        },
        {
          "text": "custom containers",
          "link": {
            "href": "#custom-containers",
            "kind": "anchor"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Unlike on GitHub, text placed right after the marker becomes the title of the alert ("
        },
        {
          "text": "> [!NOTE] Custom Title",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "), and "
        },
        {
          "text": "containers you registered yourself",
          "link": {
            "href": "#registering-new-containers",
            "kind": "anchor"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " work here too."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3d00a80dd0e4",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "md",
      "text": "> [!NOTE]\n> Highlights information that users should take into account, even when skimming.\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Optional information to help a user be more successful.\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> Crucial information necessary for users to succeed.\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> Critical content demanding immediate user attention due to potential risks.\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Negative potential consequences of an action."
    },
    {
      "id": "4ba57d84fd7b",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "note",
      "title": "NOTE",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "97e2a3bbb981",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Highlights information that users should take into account, even when skimming."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e40367deeb25",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "tip",
      "title": "TIP",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "87539056fc5c",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Optional information to help a user be more successful."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d6b583b90e77",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "info",
      "title": "IMPORTANT",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "9eb1dcd5a25d",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Crucial information necessary for users to succeed."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0651e508970e",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "warning",
      "title": "WARNING",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "d02166fabe0a",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Critical content demanding immediate user attention due to potential risks."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "62913f3d64e4",
      "kind": "callout",
      "variant": "warning",
      "title": "CAUTION",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "088641fe9b41",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Negative potential consequences of an action."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "78af3559c613",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "By default, alert colors match GitHub's, with caution and danger both rendering in red. Enable "
        },
        {
          "text": "themeConfig.gradedContainers",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ],
          "link": {
            "href": "https://vitepress.dev/reference/default-theme-config#gradedcontainers",
            "kind": "same_domain"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to use a graded severity scale: danger (red), warning (orange), and caution (yellow). Note that "
        },
        {
          "text": "[!DANGER]",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is a VitePress extension and will render as a regular blockquote on GitHub."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f04fbf9d1e61",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "anchor": "colored-diffs-in-code-blocks",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Colored Diffs in Code Blocks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fd3a1127c18d",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Adding the "
        },
        {
          "text": "// [!code --]",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " or "
        },
        {
          "text": "// [!code ++]",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " comments on a line will create a diff of that line, while keeping the colors of the codeblock."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d4ed721f597a",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Input",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a0e643060a81",
      "kind": "code",
      "text": "```js\nexport default {\n  data () {\n    return {\n      msg: 'Removed' // [!code --]\n      msg: 'Added' // [!code ++]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "d633ddbe5010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Output",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a6e6472336ed",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "export default {\n  data () {\n    return {\n      msg: 'Removed'\n      msg: 'Added'\n    }\n  }\n}"
    },
    {
      "id": "6ee779ce5699",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "anchor": "errors-and-warnings-in-code-blocks",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Errors and Warnings in Code Blocks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1b1c61d1583c",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Adding the "
        },
        {
          "text": "// [!code warning]",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " or "
        },
        {
          "text": "// [!code error]",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " comments on a line will color it accordingly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0322625da56f",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Input",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "675641e04fab",
      "kind": "code",
      "text": "```js\nexport default {\n  data () {\n    return {\n      msg: 'Error', // [!code error]\n      msg: 'Warning' // [!code warning]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "e278cbc3cbaa",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Output",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "19e66a865321",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "export default {\n  data() {\n    return {\n      msg: 'Error', \n      msg: 'Warning'\n    }\n  }\n}"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a40c926da3f",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "anchor": "line-numbers",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Line Numbers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b0566df67e90",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You can enable line numbers for each code blocks via config:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e19677d98a52",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "js",
      "text": "export default {\n  markdown: {\n    lineNumbers: true\n  }\n}"
    },
    {
      "id": "d8cae05feb87",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Please see "
        },
        {
          "text": "markdown",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ],
          "link": {
            "href": "https://vitepress.dev/reference/site-config#markdown",
            "kind": "same_domain"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " options",
          "link": {
            "href": "https://vitepress.dev/reference/site-config#markdown",
            "kind": "same_domain"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for more details."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1974f3b8849e",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You can add "
        },
        {
          "text": ":line-numbers",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " / "
        },
        {
          "text": ":no-line-numbers",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mark in your fenced code blocks to override the value set in config."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d0541f09aeac",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You can also customize the starting line number by adding "
        },
        {
          "text": "=",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " after "
        },
        {
          "text": ":line-numbers",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". For example, "
        },
        {
          "text": ":line-numbers=2",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " means the line numbers in code blocks will start from "
        },
        {
          "text": "2",
          "marks": [
            "code"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "05accb8e821d",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Input",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c68e6179ae29",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "md",
      "text": "```ts {1}\n// line-numbers is disabled by default\nconst line2 = 'This is line 2'\nconst line3 = 'This is line 3'\n```\n\n```ts:line-numbers {1}\n// line-numbers is enabled\nconst line2 = 'This is line 2'\nconst line3 = 'This is line 3'\n```\n\n```ts:line-numbers=2 {1}\n// line-numbers is enabled and start from 2\nconst line3 = 'This is line 3'\nconst line4 = 'This is line 4'\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "c82c99d3e451",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Output",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2de96b903ac2",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "ts",
      "text": "// line-numbers is disabled by default\nconst line2 = 'This is line 2'\nconst line3 = 'This is line 3'"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c3a397ce1df",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "ts",
      "text": "// line-numbers is enabled\nconst line2 = 'This is line 2'\nconst line3 = 'This is line 3'"
    },
    {
      "id": "49a9e693e413",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "ts",
      "text": "// line-numbers is enabled and start from 2\nconst line3 = 'This is line 3'\nconst line4 = 'This is line 4'"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1a389cb7fbf",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "anchor": "code-groups",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Code Groups"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bb1d872eb236",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You can group multiple code blocks like this:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c4e9dab7cf67",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Input",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0cbdc9518a78",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "md",
      "text": "::: code-group\n\n```js [config.js]\n/**\n * @type {import('vitepress').UserConfig}\n */\nconst config = {\n  // ...\n}\n\nexport default config\n```\n\n```ts [config.ts]\nimport type { UserConfig } from 'vitepress'\n\nconst config: UserConfig = {\n  // ...\n}\n\nexport default config\n```\n\n:::"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d9d4762d52c",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Output",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "21f4c9c5edcd",
      "kind": "tabs",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "config.js",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "16fec68401cf",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "js",
              "text": "/**\n * @type {import('vitepress').UserConfig}\n */\nconst config = {\n  // ...\n}\n\nexport default config"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "config.ts",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "8d7b7f20a3f3",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "ts",
              "text": "import type { UserConfig } from 'vitepress'\n\nconst config: UserConfig = {\n  // ...\n}\n\nexport default config"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "78ea25d1d7d8",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You can also "
        },
        {
          "text": "import snippets",
          "link": {
            "href": "#import-code-snippets",
            "kind": "anchor"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in code groups:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c4e9dab7cf67-2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Input",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "77993faadeb7",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "md",
      "text": "::: code-group\n\n<!-- filename is used as title by default -->\n\n<<< @/snippets/snippet.js\n\n<!-- you can provide a custom one too -->\n\n<<< @/snippets/snippet-with-region.js#snippet{1,2 ts:line-numbers} [snippet with region]\n\n:::"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d9d4762d52c-2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Output",
          "marks": [
            "bold"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3f0c62d4e61e",
      "kind": "tabs",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "snippet.js",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "9361e1951707",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "js",
              "text": "export default function () {\n  // ..\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "snippet with region",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "7c9299970122",
              "kind": "code",
              "lang": "ts",
              "text": "function foo() {\n  // ..\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
